Third-party components in the prebuilt VPK

The VPK statically links these libraries, each under its own licence:

- vita2d (MIT): https://github.com/xerpi/libvita2d
- FreeType (FreeType License): portions of this software are copyright
  (c) 2026 The FreeType Project (www.freetype.org). All rights reserved.
- libpng (PNG Reference Library License v2), libjpeg-turbo (IJG / BSD-style),
  zlib (zlib License), bzip2 (bzip2 License)
- VitaSDK runtime and stubs: https://vitasdk.org
